&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role..&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The Group Insight &amp;amp; Analysis Director is a new senior leadership role created as part of Soho House&#39;s Commercial Finance transformation, established to sit at the forefront of AI-enabled applications within Commercial Finance. The role establishes a dedicated, specialist insight and analytics capability, moving Commercial Finance away from transactional reporting and towards forward-looking, AI-enabled insight that drives trade performance and shapes decisions across Membership, Food &amp;amp; Beverage, Rooms, Health &amp;amp; Wellbeing and strategic space planning.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;This is a value- and growth-oriented role. The Director will drive trade initiatives through forward-looking insight, and will own and manage key, critical projects across the business — including pricing, cost management and other growth plans — supporting initiatives such as labour scheduling projects and trade-driving programmes. Through a constant cadence of daily and weekly insight, the Director will hold the business to account for performance, ensuring decisions are grounded in evidence and focused on value creation. The role also supports both Operational FP&amp;amp;A and Group FP&amp;amp;A with budgeting and forecasting, providing the site-level insight needed for operational execution.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Leading a dedicated team of senior insight and analytics professionals, the Director will work in close partnership with the Digital and Data Science teams — including our data scientist(s) — to embed AI-enabled analytics, automation and advanced data modelling into how Soho House understands its Members and drives commercial performance. The role is instrumental in shaping data architecture and insight capability in collaboration with Digital, rather than duplicating it within Finance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities..&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Trade Performance, Growth &amp;amp; Value Creation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Drive trade-driving initiatives across the business, providing forward-looking insight that identifies and unlocks commercial value and growth opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
